# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh). Hand-made from frame dumps
# of the played build, not from a TAS.
# Late-game save check, session 2. Start: late_e22_k1.keys' end save (Eirika's route final
# chapter, turn 1, Eirika has waited, suspended). Resume (writes the resumed state back), the map
# menu on grey Eirika, End: the enemy phase (the reinforcements appear; no battles), turn 2's
# player phase from about 3,200 on the PC (suspend saves). The rest is slack for mGBA's lag frames.
# 5000 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
#
000*250
001*2      # 250: A, health and safety
000*748
008*2      # 1000: Start, skip the opening
000*298
001*2      # 1300: A, title: the title menu
000*198
001*2      # 1500: A, Resume Chapter
000*198
001*2      # 1700: A, resume (the map from 1,800 on the PC)
000*298
001*2      # 2000: A on grey Eirika: the map menu
000*148
040*2      # 2150: Up, wraps to End
000*148
001*2      # 2300: A, End: the enemy phase
000*2698
